Short:        Partition-table library
Uploader:     jaroslav.pulchart@gmail.com (Jaroslav Pulchart)
Author:       jaroslav.pulchart@gmail.com (Jaroslav Pulchart)
Type:         util/libs
Version:      @VERSION@
Requires:     AmigaOS 2.0+
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Replaces:     util/libs/ptable.v20261007.lha
Kurz:         Partitionstabellen-Library

ptable.library is the AmigaOS partition-table library (one place that parses
RDB, MBR, GPT and flat layouts and publishes every partition into a shared
partition.resource) so a device driver and a filesystem handler never each
carry their own partition parser.

It was assembled from existing code: the library framework and RDB
cold-boot path came from compactflash.device (pre 2.0), the MBR/GPT
scanning from fat95 (pre 4.0).

Consumed by
* compactflash.device 2.0+ (driver/media/cfd) and
* fat95 4.0+ (disk/misc/fat95).

